# Written by ggen: signing.key is this checkout's private ed25519 seed and must
# never be committed (a committed seed signs receipts for anyone who can read the
# repository). verifying.key is ignored too: every checkout owns its own pair, and a
# tracked public half without its private half makes a fresh clone's first sync
# refuse [FM-KEY-010]/[FM-KEY-011]. Publish the public key out of band.
signing.key
verifying.key
